IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `tulrca-types`
IMPORT `tulrca-periods`
IMPORT `tulrca-union`
IMPORT `tulrca-redundancy`
IMPORT `tulrca-goal`

-- Trade Union and Labour Relations (Consolidation) Act 1992 (UK) — the
-- encoder's tests. Expected values are worked by hand from the Act.

§ `Tests`

§§ `Goal 1 — union membership and activities`

-- Fields: reason, appropriate time, employee, treatment, others kept on,
-- act on, early conciliation, effective date of termination, interim relief
-- applied for, certificate, s 145A(1)(d) offer, basic award.
GIVEN why IS A `Union reason`, what IS A `Treatment`, dd IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Union case`
`a case for` why `,` what `, on` dd MEANS
    `Union case` OF why, TRUE, TRUE, what, TRUE, dd, NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING, FALSE, 3000

#ASSERT `I am protected under the union provisions` (`a case for` `membership of an independent trade union` `,` `a detriment short of dismissal` `, on` (Date 10 3 2026))
#ASSERT NOT (`I am protected under the union provisions` (`Union case` OF `taking part in independent union activities`, FALSE, TRUE, `a detriment short of dismissal`, TRUE, Date 10 3 2026, NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING, FALSE, 3000))
#ASSERT `I am protected under the union provisions` (`a case for` `taking part in independent union activities` `,` `dismissal` `, on` (Date 10 3 2026))
#ASSERT `the qualifying period is disapplied for` (`a case for` `taking part in independent union activities` `,` `dismissal` `, on` (Date 10 3 2026))
#ASSERT NOT (`the qualifying period is disapplied for` (`a case for` `membership of an independent trade union` `,` `a detriment short of dismissal` `, on` (Date 10 3 2026)))
-- Changed after the independent pass: a worker who is not an employee keeps
-- s 146 when the engagement is ended (s 146(5A)).
#ASSERT `I am protected under the union provisions` (`Union case` OF `membership of an independent trade union`, TRUE, FALSE, `dismissal`, TRUE, Date 10 3 2026, NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING, FALSE, 3000)
#ASSERT NOT (`the qualifying period is disapplied for` (`Union case` OF `membership of an independent trade union`, TRUE, FALSE, `dismissal`, TRUE, Date 10 3 2026, NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING, FALSE, 3000))
#ASSERT `the last day to complain of the detriment for` (`Union case` OF `membership of an independent trade union`, TRUE, FALSE, `dismissal`, TRUE, Date 10 3 2026, NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING, FALSE, 3000) EQUALS JUST (Date 9 6 2026)
#ASSERT `I am protected under the union provisions` (`a case for` `not being a member` `,` `selection for redundancy` `, on` (Date 10 3 2026))
#ASSERT NOT (`I am protected under the union provisions` (`Union case` OF `not being a member`, TRUE, TRUE, `selection for redundancy`, FALSE, Date 10 3 2026, NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING, FALSE, 3000))
#ASSERT NOT (`I am protected under the union provisions` (`a case for` `some other reason` `,` `dismissal` `, on` (Date 10 3 2026)))
#ASSERT `I am protected under the union provisions` (`a case for` `refusing payments in lieu of membership` `,` `a detriment short of dismissal` `, on` (Date 10 3 2026))

-- s 147: three months beginning with 10 March 2026 end on 9 June 2026.
#ASSERT `the last day to complain of the detriment for` (`a case for` `membership of an independent trade union` `,` `a detriment short of dismissal` `, on` (Date 10 3 2026)) EQUALS JUST (Date 9 6 2026)
#ASSERT `the last day to complain of the detriment for` (`a case for` `membership of an independent trade union` `,` `dismissal` `, on` (Date 10 3 2026)) EQUALS NOTHING
-- 30 November 2025: no 30 February, so 28 February 2026.
#ASSERT `the last day to complain of the detriment for` (`a case for` `membership of an independent trade union` `,` `a detriment short of dismissal` `, on` (Date 30 11 2025)) EQUALS JUST (Date 28 2 2026)
#ASSERT `the last day to complain of the detriment for` (`a case for` `membership of an independent trade union` `,` `a detriment short of dismissal` `, on` (Date 31 5 2026)) EQUALS JUST (Date 30 8 2026)

-- s 292A. Day A 1 May, Day B 15 May: 2-15 May (14 days) are not counted:
-- 9 June + 14 = 23 June, after one month from Day B (15 June).
GIVEN a IS A DATE, b IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Union case`
`a detriment on 10 March 2026 with ACAS from` a `to` b MEANS
    `Union case` OF `membership of an independent trade union`, TRUE, TRUE, `a detriment short of dismissal`, TRUE, Date 10 3 2026, JUST (`Early conciliation` OF a, b), NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING, FALSE, 3000

#ASSERT `the last day to complain of the detriment for` (`a detriment on 10 March 2026 with ACAS from` (Date 1 5 2026) `to` (Date 15 5 2026)) EQUALS JUST (Date 23 6 2026)
-- Day A 1 June, Day B 5 June: 9 June + 4 = 13 June, within one month of Day
-- B, so 5 July.
#ASSERT `the last day to complain of the detriment for` (`a detriment on 10 March 2026 with ACAS from` (Date 1 6 2026) `to` (Date 5 6 2026)) EQUALS JUST (Date 5 7 2026)
-- Day A after the limit: no extension.
#ASSERT `the last day to complain of the detriment for` (`a detriment on 10 March 2026 with ACAS from` (Date 10 6 2026) `to` (Date 20 6 2026)) EQUALS JUST (Date 9 6 2026)

-- s 161: effective date of termination 1 April 2026; the seven days end on
-- 8 April.
GIVEN why IS A `Union reason`, ap IS A MAYBE DATE, cert IS A MAYBE DATE, d145 IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Union case`
`a dismissal for` why `applied` ap `certificate` cert `under 145A(1)(d)` d145 MEANS
    `Union case` OF why, TRUE, TRUE, `dismissal`, TRUE, Date 1 4 2026, NOTHING, JUST (Date 1 4 2026), ap, cert, d145, 3000

#ASSERT `the last day to apply for interim relief for` (`a dismissal for` `membership of an independent trade union` `applied` NOTHING `certificate` NOTHING `under 145A(1)(d)` FALSE) EQUALS JUST (Date 8 4 2026)
#ASSERT `my interim relief application is in time for` (`a dismissal for` `membership of an independent trade union` `applied` (JUST (Date 8 4 2026)) `certificate` (JUST (Date 8 4 2026)) `under 145A(1)(d)` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`my interim relief application is in time for` (`a dismissal for` `membership of an independent trade union` `applied` (JUST (Date 9 4 2026)) `certificate` (JUST (Date 8 4 2026)) `under 145A(1)(d)` FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`my interim relief application is in time for` (`a dismissal for` `membership of an independent trade union` `applied` (JUST (Date 8 4 2026)) `certificate` NOTHING `under 145A(1)(d)` FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`my interim relief application is in time for` (`a dismissal for` `membership of an independent trade union` `applied` (JUST (Date 8 4 2026)) `certificate` (JUST (Date 9 4 2026)) `under 145A(1)(d)` FALSE))
#ASSERT `my interim relief application is in time for` (`a dismissal for` `not being a member` `applied` (JUST (Date 8 4 2026)) `certificate` NOTHING `under 145A(1)(d)` FALSE)
#ASSERT `my interim relief application is in time for` (`a dismissal for` `membership of an independent trade union` `applied` (JUST (Date 25 3 2026)) `certificate` (JUST (Date 25 3 2026)) `under 145A(1)(d)` FALSE)
#ASSERT `my interim relief application is in time for` (`a dismissal for` `refusing an unlawful inducement` `applied` (JUST (Date 8 4 2026)) `certificate` NOTHING `under 145A(1)(d)` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`my interim relief application is in time for` (`a dismissal for` `refusing an unlawful inducement` `applied` (JUST (Date 8 4 2026)) `certificate` NOTHING `under 145A(1)(d)` FALSE))
#ASSERT `the last day to apply for interim relief for` (`a case for` `membership of an independent trade union` `,` `a detriment short of dismissal` `, on` (Date 10 3 2026)) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT (`my interim relief application is in time for` (`a case for` `membership of an independent trade union` `,` `a detriment short of dismissal` `, on` (Date 10 3 2026)))

-- s 156(1): the minimum basic award.
#ASSERT `the basic award before reductions for` (`a case for` `membership of an independent trade union` `,` `dismissal` `, on` (Date 10 3 2026)) EQUALS 9157
#ASSERT `the basic award before reductions for` (`Union case` OF `membership of an independent trade union`, TRUE, TRUE, `dismissal`, TRUE, Date 10 3 2026, NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING, FALSE, 12000) EQUALS 12000
#ASSERT `the basic award before reductions for` (`a case for` `some other reason` `,` `dismissal` `, on` (Date 10 3 2026)) EQUALS 3000
#ASSERT `the basic award before reductions for` (`a case for` `not being a member` `,` `selection for redundancy` `, on` (Date 10 3 2026)) EQUALS 9157

§§ `Goal 2 — collective redundancies`

-- Fields: in all, at my establishment, threshold, first dismissal, last
-- dismissal, consultation began, early conciliation, award.
GIVEN total IS A NUMBER, est IS A NUMBER, thr IS A NUMBER, began IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `Redundancy case`
`proposing` total `in all,` est `here, threshold` thr `, consulting from` began MEANS
    `Redundancy case` OF total, est, thr, Date 1 6 2026, Date 30 6 2026, began, NOTHING, NOTHING

#ASSERT `consultation is required for` (`proposing` 25 `in all,` 25 `here, threshold` 20 `, consulting from` NOTHING)
-- 30 days before 1 June 2026 is 2 May.
#ASSERT `the last day for consultation to begin for` (`proposing` 25 `in all,` 25 `here, threshold` 20 `, consulting from` NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 2 5 2026)
#ASSERT `consultation began in time for` (`proposing` 25 `in all,` 25 `here, threshold` 20 `, consulting from` (JUST (Date 2 5 2026)))
#ASSERT NOT (`consultation began in time for` (`proposing` 25 `in all,` 25 `here, threshold` 20 `, consulting from` (JUST (Date 3 5 2026))))
#ASSERT NOT (`consultation began in time for` (`proposing` 25 `in all,` 25 `here, threshold` 20 `, consulting from` NOTHING))
-- 45 days before 1 June 2026 is 17 April.
#ASSERT `the last day for consultation to begin for` (`proposing` 120 `in all,` 60 `here, threshold` 20 `, consulting from` NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 17 4 2026)
#ASSERT NOT (`consultation is required for` (`proposing` 15 `in all,` 15 `here, threshold` 20 `, consulting from` NOTHING))
#ASSERT `the last day for consultation to begin for` (`proposing` 15 `in all,` 15 `here, threshold` 20 `, consulting from` NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `consultation began in time for` (`proposing` 15 `in all,` 15 `here, threshold` 20 `, consulting from` NOTHING)
-- Below the threshold in all, but 120 at the establishment: 45 days.
#ASSERT `the last day for consultation to begin for` (`proposing` 150 `in all,` 120 `here, threshold` 200 `, consulting from` NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 17 4 2026)
#ASSERT NOT (`consultation is required for` (`proposing` 150 `in all,` 19 `here, threshold` 200 `, consulting from` NOTHING))

-- Fields: award made on, days determined, a week's pay, days not payable,
-- last unpaid day, early conciliation for non-payment.
base MEANS `proposing` 25 `in all,` 25 `here, threshold` 20 `, consulting from` NOTHING
a90 MEANS `Protective award` OF Date 1 9 2026, 90, 700, 0, JUST (Date 29 8 2026), NOTHING
a200 MEANS `Protective award` OF Date 1 9 2026, 200, 700, 0, NOTHING, NOTHING
a90less MEANS `Protective award` OF Date 1 9 2026, 90, 700, 20, NOTHING, NOTHING
early MEANS `Protective award` OF Date 1 5 2026, 10, 700, 0, NOTHING, NOTHING

#ASSERT `the first day of the protected period for` base `under` a90 EQUALS Date 1 6 2026
#ASSERT `the last day of the protected period for` base `under` a90 EQUALS Date 29 8 2026
#ASSERT `my remuneration under` a90 EQUALS 9000
#ASSERT `the last day of the protected period for` base `under` a200 EQUALS Date 27 11 2026
#ASSERT `my remuneration under` a200 EQUALS 18000
#ASSERT `my remuneration under` a90less EQUALS 7000
#ASSERT `my remuneration under` early EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `the first day of the protected period for` base `under` early EQUALS Date 1 5 2026
-- s 189(5): last dismissal 30 June 2026: 29 September 2026.
#ASSERT `the last day for a protective award complaint for` base EQUALS Date 29 9 2026
-- s 192(2): last unpaid day 29 August 2026: 28 November 2026.
#ASSERT `the last day to complain of non-payment under` a90 EQUALS JUST (Date 28 11 2026)
#ASSERT `the last day to complain of non-payment under` a200 EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Goal 3 — protected industrial action`

#ASSERT `my dismissal is unfair under s 238A for` (`Industrial action case` OF TRUE, TRUE, NOTHING, Date 31 8 2026)
#ASSERT NOT (`my dismissal is unfair under s 238A for` (`Industrial action case` OF TRUE, FALSE, NOTHING, Date 31 8 2026))
#ASSERT NOT (`my dismissal is unfair under s 238A for` (`Industrial action case` OF FALSE, TRUE, NOTHING, Date 31 8 2026))
-- s 238(5)(a): notice given 15 January 2026: six months end on 14 July 2026.
#ASSERT `the last day to complain of an industrial action dismissal for` (`Industrial action case` OF TRUE, TRUE, JUST (Date 15 1 2026), Date 15 2 2026) EQUALS Date 14 7 2026
-- s 238(5)(b): 31 August 2026: no 31 February, so 28 February 2027.
#ASSERT `the last day to complain of an industrial action dismissal for` (`Industrial action case` OF TRUE, TRUE, NOTHING, Date 31 8 2026) EQUALS Date 28 2 2027

§§ `The top-level goal`

empty MEANS `Worker case` OF NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING
full MEANS `Worker case` OF JUST (`a dismissal for` `membership of an independent trade union` `applied` (JUST (Date 8 4 2026)) `certificate` (JUST (Date 8 4 2026)) `under 145A(1)(d)` FALSE), JUST (`Redundancy case` OF 25, 25, 20, Date 1 6 2026, Date 30 6 2026, JUST (Date 2 5 2026), NOTHING, JUST a90), JUST (`Industrial action case` OF TRUE, TRUE, NOTHING, Date 31 8 2026)

#ASSERT (`the worker position for` empty)'s `protected on union grounds` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`the worker position for` empty)'s `consultation required` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`the worker position for` empty)'s `industrial action dismissal unfair` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`the worker position for` full)'s `protected on union grounds` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`the worker position for` full)'s `qualifying period disapplied` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`the worker position for` full)'s `last day to complain of the detriment` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`the worker position for` full)'s `last day to apply for interim relief` EQUALS JUST (Date 8 4 2026)
#ASSERT (`the worker position for` full)'s `interim relief application in time` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`the worker position for` full)'s `basic award before reductions` EQUALS JUST 9157
#ASSERT (`the worker position for` full)'s `consultation required` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`the worker position for` full)'s `last day for consultation to begin` EQUALS JUST (Date 2 5 2026)
#ASSERT (`the worker position for` full)'s `consultation began in time` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`the worker position for` full)'s `first day of the protected period` EQUALS JUST (Date 1 6 2026)
#ASSERT (`the worker position for` full)'s `last day of the protected period` EQUALS JUST (Date 29 8 2026)
#ASSERT (`the worker position for` full)'s `remuneration under the protective award` EQUALS JUST 9000
#ASSERT (`the worker position for` full)'s `last day for the protective award complaint` EQUALS JUST (Date 29 9 2026)
#ASSERT (`the worker position for` full)'s `last day to complain of non-payment` EQUALS JUST (Date 28 11 2026)
#ASSERT (`the worker position for` full)'s `industrial action dismissal unfair` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`the worker position for` full)'s `last day to complain of the industrial action dismissal` EQUALS JUST (Date 28 2 2027)
